<h3><u>Bhaiyya Ali akbar</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Bhaiyya aliakbar, bhaiyya aliakbar..(4)</p>

<p>Bhaiyya aliakbar, bhaiyya aliakbar</p>

<p>Sughra ne ye khat akbar ko likha, Kese ho mere pyaare bhaiyya</p>

<p>Bichde hue arsa beet gaya, kab tak ye bahen dekhe rasta</p>

<p>Jab ghar ko parinde jaate hai,</p>

<p>&nbsp;kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai..(2)</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Lo qaside sughra ghar se chala, likha hai batao ae bhaiyya</p>

<p>Ab tak na khayaal aaya mera, kya aisi hui hai mujhse khata</p>

<p>Kya aise rooth ke jaate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Sab chod gaye hum ko tanha, kis haal me hu kya tumko pata</p>

<p>Beemar ko de ab kaun dawa, ajao jo tum mai pau shifa</p>

<p>Jab chain se sab sojate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Jab ba li sakina aur asghar, milte hai gale tumse haskar</p>

<p>Aur saath me ho maa aur padar, bus itna bata bhaiyya akbar</p>

<p>Sab ghar me haste hasate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Jab jab bhi musalle par bhaiyya, karte ho namaze fajr ada</p>

<p>Beemar ke haq me behre shifa, karte hai dua mere baba</p>

<p>Sab apne haath uthate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Qasim jo sakina ko bhaiyya, deta hai&nbsp; koi laakar tohfa</p>

<p>Dono se gale milkar baba, dete hai dua lekar bosa</p>

<p>Aur pyaar se sar sehlate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Jab ghar me khushi ka ho saama, sab ek jagah ho peero jawa</p>

<p>Khush dekhke sab ko ho amma, aajae koi ghar me mehma</p>

<p>Jab dastarkhan bichate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Hasrat hai tera sehra dekhu, majae tera matha chumu</p>

<p>Bate to bohot hai kya likhu, nadir hu bhaiyya kya bheju</p>

<p>Ehbaab jo tohfe laate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Jab zikr kabhi hota hoga, majae tumhare shadi ka</p>

<p>Khush hongi sakina aur kubra, bandhega aliakbar sehra</p>

<p>Khushiyo ke phool khilate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Kya aur likhu kya batlau, dil cheer ke kaise dikhlau</p>

<p>Khud aau ke tumko bulwau, bhaiyya mai tujhe kese pau</p>

<p>Bus tanha ashk bahate hai, kya hum bhi tumhe yaad aate hai</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Qasid jo khate sughra laya, ek baap kamar thame tha khada</p>

<p>Bhai ke labo par tha sughra, roro ke shanawar aur raza</p>

<p>Khat sughra ka dohrate hai..</p>

<p>Bhaiyya ali akbar, bhaiyya ali akbar..(2)</p>
</p>